# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Un curs IBM gratuit despre informație și calcul cuantic"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analiză"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we'll analyze Grover's algorithm to understand how it works.\n"
"We'll start with what could be described as a *symbolic* analysis, where we calculate how the Grover operation $G$ acts on certain states, and then we'll tie this symbolic analysis to a *geometric* picture that's helpful for visualizing how the algorithm works.\n"
msgstr ""
"Acum vom analiza algoritmul lui Grover pentru a înțelege cum funcționează.\n"
"Vom începe cu ceea ce s-ar putea descrie ca o analiză *simbolică*, în care calculăm cum acționează operația Grover $G$ asupra anumitor stări, după care vom lega această analiză simbolică de o imagine *geometrică* ce ajută la vizualizarea modului în care funcționează algoritmul.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Solutions and non-solutions {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"
msgstr "Soluții și non-soluții {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let's start by defining two sets of strings.\n"
msgstr "Să începem prin definirea a două mulțimi de șiruri.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The set $A_1$ contains all of the solutions to our search problem while $A_0$ contains the strings that aren't solutions (which we can refer to as *non-solutions* when it's convenient).\n"
"These two sets satisfy $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ and $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n,$ which is to say that this is a *bipartition* of $\\Sigma^n.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Mulțimea $A_1$ conține toate soluțiile problemei noastre de căutare, iar $A_0$ conține șirurile care nu sunt soluții (pe care le putem numi *non-soluții* atunci când este convenabil).\n"
"Aceste două mulțimi satisfac $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ și $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n,$ adică formează o *bipartiție* a lui $\\Sigma^n.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next we'll define two unit vectors representing uniform superpositions over "
"the sets of solutions and non-solutions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vom defini în continuare doi vectori unitari care reprezintă superpozițiile "
"uniforme peste mulțimile de soluții și non-soluții.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Formally speaking, each of these vectors is only defined when its corresponding set is nonempty, but hereafter we're going to focus on the case that neither $A_0$ nor $A_1$ is empty.\n"
"The cases that $A_0 = \\varnothing$ and $A_1 = \\varnothing$ are easily handled separately, and we'll do that later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Formal vorbind, fiecare dintre acești vectori este definit doar când mulțimea corespunzătoare este nevidă, dar de acum înainte ne vom concentra pe cazul în care nici $A_0$ nici $A_1$ nu sunt vide.\n"
"Cazurile $A_0 = \\varnothing$ și $A_1 = \\varnothing$ se tratează ușor separat, și le vom aborda mai târziu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an aside, the notation being used here is common: any time we have a "
"finite and nonempty set $S,$ we can write $\\vert S\\rangle$ to denote the "
"quantum state vector that's uniform over the elements of $S.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ca notă, notația folosită aici este comună: ori de câte ori avem o mulțime "
"finită și nevidă $S,$ putem scrie $\\vert S\\rangle$ pentru a denota "
"vectorul de stare cuantică uniform distribuit peste elementele lui $S.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's also define $\\vert u \\rangle$ to be a *uniform* quantum state over "
"all $n$-bit strings:\n"
msgstr ""
"Să definim și $\\vert u \\rangle$ ca starea cuantică *uniformă* peste toate "
"șirurile de $n$ biți:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Notice that\n"
msgstr "Observă că\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We also have that $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle,$ "
"so $\\vert u\\rangle$ represents the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ "
"after the initialization in step 1 of Grover's algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"Avem de asemenea că $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle,$"
" deci $\\vert u\\rangle$ reprezintă starea registrului $\\mathsf{Q}$ după "
"inițializarea din pasul 1 al algoritmului lui Grover.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implies that just before the iterations of $G$ happen in step 2, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ is contained in the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ and moreover the coefficients of these vectors are real numbers.\n"
"As we will see, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ will always have these properties — meaning that the state is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — after any number of iterations of the operation $G$ in step 2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aceasta implică faptul că, chiar înainte ca iterațiile lui $G$ să aibă loc în pasul 2, starea lui $\\mathsf{Q}$ este conținută în spațiul vectorial bidimensional generat de $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ iar coeficienții acestor vectori sunt numere reale.\n"
"Așa cum vom vedea, starea lui $\\mathsf{Q}$ va păstra întotdeauna aceste proprietăți — adică starea este o combinație liniară reală a lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — după orice număr de iterații ale operației $G$ din pasul 2.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An observation about the Grover operation {#an-observation-about-the-grover-"
"operation}"
msgstr ""
"O observație despre operația Grover {#an-observation-about-the-grover-"
"operation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We'll now turn our attention to the Grover operation\n"
msgstr "Ne vom îndrepta acum atenția spre operația Grover\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "beginning with an interesting observation about it.\n"
msgstr "începând cu o observație interesantă despre aceasta.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Imagine for a moment that we replaced the function $f$ by the composition of $f$ with the NOT function — or, in other words, the function we get by flipping the output bit of $f.$\n"
"We'll call this new function $g,$ and we can express it using symbols in a few alternative ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Imaginează-ți pentru un moment că am înlocui funcția $f$ cu compoziția lui $f$ cu funcția NOT — sau, cu alte cuvinte, funcția obținută prin negarea bitului de ieșire al lui $f.$\n"
"Vom numi această funcție nouă $g$ și o putem exprima în simboluri în câteva moduri alternative.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ and therefore\n"
msgstr "pentru orice șir $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ și prin urmare\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This means that if we were to substitute the function $f$ with the function "
"$g,$ Grover's algorithm wouldn't function any differently — because the "
"states we obtain from the algorithm in the two cases are necessarily "
"equivalent up to a global phase.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aceasta înseamnă că, dacă am substitui funcția $f$ cu funcția $g,$ "
"algoritmul lui Grover nu ar funcționa diferit — deoarece stările obținute "
"din algoritm în cele două cazuri sunt în mod necesar echivalente la o fază "
"globală.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This isn't a problem!\n"
"Intuitively speaking, the algorithm doesn't care which strings are solutions and which are non-solutions — it only needs to be able to *distinguish* solutions and non-solutions to operate correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aceasta nu este o problemă!\n"
"Intuitiv vorbind, algoritmului nu îi pasă care șiruri sunt soluții și care nu — trebuie doar să poată *distinge* soluțiile de non-soluții pentru a funcționa corect.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Action of the Grover operation {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"
msgstr "Acțiunea operației Grover {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's consider the action of $G$ on the quantum state vectors $\\vert "
"A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Acum să analizăm acțiunea lui $G$ asupra vectorilor de stare cuantică "
"$\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, let's observe that the operation $Z_f$ has a very simple action on "
"$\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Mai întâi, să observăm că operația $Z_f$ are o acțiune foarte simplă asupra "
"lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Second, we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"The operation $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is defined as\n"
msgstr ""
"În al doilea rând, avem operația $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"Operația $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ este definită ca\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"again for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ and a convenient alternative way to"
" express this operation is like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"din nou pentru orice șir $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ iar o modalitate alternativă "
"convenabilă de a exprima această operație este următoarea:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A simple way to verify that this expression agrees with the definition of "
"$Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is to evaluate its action on standard basis states.\n"
msgstr ""
"O modalitate simplă de a verifica că această expresie este în concordanță cu"
" definiția lui $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ este să evaluăm acțiunea sa asupra "
"stărilor din baza standard.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ can therefore"
" be written like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Operația $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ poate fi astfel "
"scrisă:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"using the same notation, $\\vert u \\rangle,$ that we used above for the "
"uniform superposition over all $n$-bit strings.\n"
msgstr ""
"folosind aceeași notație, $\\vert u \\rangle,$ pe care am folosit-o mai sus "
"pentru superpozița uniformă peste toate șirurile de $n$ biți.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And now we have what we need to compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"First let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Acum avem tot ce ne trebuie pentru a calcula acțiunea lui $G$ asupra lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"Să calculăm mai întâi acțiunea lui $G$ asupra lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "And second, let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"În al doilea rând, să calculăm acțiunea lui $G$ asupra lui $\\vert "
"A_1\\rangle.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In both cases we're using the equation\n"
msgstr "În ambele cazuri folosim ecuația\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "along with the expressions\n"
msgstr "împreună cu expresiile\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{și}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "that follow.\n"
msgstr "care rezultă din aceasta.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In summary, we have\n"
msgstr "Pe scurt, avem\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we already noted, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ just prior to step 2 is contained in the two-dimensional space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ and we have just established that $G$ maps any vector in this space to another vector in the same space.\n"
"This means that, for the sake of the analysis, we can focus our attention exclusively on this subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Așa cum am notat deja, starea lui $\\mathsf{Q}$ imediat înainte de pasul 2 este conținută în spațiul bidimensional generat de $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ și tocmai am stabilit că $G$ mapează orice vector din acest spațiu la un alt vector din același spațiu.\n"
"Aceasta înseamnă că, în scopul analizei, ne putem concentra atenția exclusiv pe acest subspațiu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To better understand what's happening within this two-dimensional space, "
"let's express the action of $G$ on this space as a matrix,\n"
msgstr ""
"Pentru a înțelege mai bine ce se întâmplă în cadrul acestui spațiu "
"bidimensional, să exprimăm acțiunea lui $G$ pe acest spațiu ca o matrice,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"whose first and second rows/columns correspond to $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ respectively.\n"
"So far in this series, we've always connected the rows and columns of matrices with the classical states of a system, but matrices can also be used to describe the actions of linear mappings on different bases like we have here.\n"
msgstr ""
"ale cărei prime și a doua rânduri/coloane corespund respectiv lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"Până acum în această serie, am conectat întotdeauna rândurile și coloanele matricelor cu stările clasice ale unui sistem, dar matricele pot fi folosite și pentru a descrie acțiunile aplicațiilor liniare pe baze diferite, cum avem aici.\n"
"Deși nu este deloc evident la prima vedere, matricea $M$ este ceea ce obținem *ridicând la pătrat* o matrice cu un aspect mai simplu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"While it isn't at all obvious at first glance, the matrix $M$ is what we "
"obtain by *squaring* a simpler-looking matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "Matricea\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The matrix\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "este o *matrice de rotație*, pe care o putem exprima alternativ ca\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "is a *rotation matrix*, which we can alternatively express as\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "pentru\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Acest unghi $\\theta$ va juca un rol foarte important în analiza care "
"urmează, deci merită să subliniem importanța sa aici, când îl întâlnim "
"pentru prima dată.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This angle $\\theta$ is going to play a very important role in the analysis "
"that follows, so it's worth stressing its importance here as we see it for "
"the first time.\n"
msgstr "Ținând cont de această expresie a matricei, observăm că\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In light of this expression of this matrix, we observe that\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Acest lucru se datorează faptului că a roti cu unghiul $\\theta$ de două ori este echivalent cu a roti cu unghiul $2\\theta.$\n"
"O altă modalitate de a vedea acest lucru este să folosim expresia alternativă\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is because rotating by the angle $\\theta$ two times is equivalent to rotating by the angle $2\\theta.$\n"
"Another way to see this is to make use of the alternative expression\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "împreună cu formulele *unghiului dublu* din trigonometrie:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "together with the *double angle* formulas from trigonometry:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"În rezumat, starea registrului $\\mathsf{Q}$ la începutul pasului 2 este\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"In summary, the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ at the start of step 2 is\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"iar efectul aplicării lui $G$ asupra acestei stări este de a o roti cu un unghi $2\\theta$ în spațiul generat de $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"Astfel, de exemplu, avem\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and the effect of applying $G$ to this state is to rotate it by an angle $2\\theta$ within the space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"So, for example, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "și în general\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and in general\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Geometric picture {#geometric-picture}"
msgstr "Imaginea geometrică {#geometric-picture}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's connect the analysis we just went through to a geometric picture.\n"
"The idea is that the operation $G$ is the product of two *reflections*,\n"
"$Z_f$ and $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"And the net effect of performing two reflections is to perform a *rotation*.\n"
msgstr ""
"Acum să conectăm analiza prin care tocmai am trecut la o imagine geometrică.\n"
"Ideea este că operația $G$ este produsul a două *reflecții*,\n"
"$Z_f$ și $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"Iar efectul net al compunerii a două reflecții este de a efectua o *rotație*.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's start with $Z_f.$\n"
"As we already observed previously, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Să începem cu $Z_f.$\n"
"Așa cum am observat deja anterior, avem\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$\n"
"this is a *reflection* about the line parallel to $\\vert A_0\\rangle,$ which we'll call $L_1.$\n"
"Here's a figure illustrating the action of this reflection on a hypothetical unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$\n"
"which we're assuming is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"În spațiul vectorial bidimensional generat de $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$\n"
"aceasta este o *reflecție* față de dreapta paralelă cu $\\vert A_0\\rangle,$ pe care o vom numi $L_1.$\n"
"Iată o figură care ilustrează acțiunea acestei reflecții asupra unui vector unitar ipotetic $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$\n"
"pe care îl presupunem a fi o combinație liniară reală a lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A figure depicting the action of a reflection on a "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![O figură care descrie acțiunea unei reflecții asupra unui "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Second we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes "
"n},$ which we've already seen can be written as\n"
msgstr ""
"În al doilea rând, avem operația $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} "
"H^{\\otimes n},$ pe care am văzut deja că o putem scrie ca\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is also a reflection, this time about the line $L_2$ parallel to the vector $\\vert u\\rangle.$\n"
"Here's a figure depicting the action of this reflection on a unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Aceasta este tot o reflecție, de data aceasta față de dreapta $L_2$ paralelă cu vectorul $\\vert u\\rangle.$\n"
"Iată o figură care descrie acțiunea acestei reflecții asupra unui vector unitar $\\vert\\psi\\rangle.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A figure depicting the action of a second reflection on a "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![O figură care descrie acțiunea unei a doua reflecții asupra unui "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When we compose these two reflections, we obtain a rotation — by twice the "
"angle between the lines of reflection — as this figure illustrates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Când compunem aceste două reflecții, obținem o rotație — cu dublul unghiului"
" dintre dreptele de reflecție — după cum ilustrează această figură.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A figure depicting the action of the Grover operation on a "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![O figură care descrie acțiunea operației Grover asupra unui "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This explains, in geometric terms, why the effect of the Grover operation is"
" to rotate linear combinations of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert "
"A_1\\rangle$ by an angle of $2\\theta.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Aceasta explică, în termeni geometrici, de ce efectul operației Grover este "
"de a roti combinațiile liniare ale lui $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ și $\\vert "
"A_1\\rangle$ cu un unghi de $2\\theta.$\n"
